    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9592a54edcbb3e7603f59aa2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "勇敢之心――是绝对不会放弃的。\n即使现在已经不是她的全盛期……\n那颗“勇敢之心”也能让她奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2ce67674879505bb9b8bc77125c31e33558b5c5ac25c6b48377a5879268e255",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
