    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6d90b6878990fc948b86396",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在泥地赛道里，跑先行有优势。\n因为速度不好提上来，\n先行赛马娘直接跑赢的情况有很多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9993bd646884f8cf279d1a9626e3b7a50239f3b81655b765181ba7ea5d72abab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
