    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53ce5d70f537e271e671d19b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一次跑泥地的赛马娘，\n大多会害怕尖锐的砂石。\n结果导致无法顺利更换赛道。但她――",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb194b2e573efdbb42ebb5f197461149ed07a8cb0d63e2b281a74456da8ad37d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
